{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我開門。」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0213", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好好，拜託妳了。」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我回來了，歡迎回來。」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0214", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我回來了，歡迎回來。那我去把買的東西放進冰箱喔。」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一起做。」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0215", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "開始在結女上學後接觸各種女孩子的機會增加了，不過到了假日基本上還是跟櫻乃在一起。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是三連休第二天，我陪她出門購物。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「假日葛格一直都在，好輕鬆。」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0216", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈。如果隼太有空的話，我或許就跟他去哪裡玩了。」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太學長，合併試辦開始後就很忙。」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0217", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對，畢竟他有擔任職務。所以我也不好約他。」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過，就算不是那樣，這個三連休我也打算陪著櫻乃喔。」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「為什麼？」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0218", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「比如便當之類的，越來越麻煩妳了。」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0219", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那當然是體貼，但不是只有那樣。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "開始習慣結女的生活後，我反倒越來越感受到櫻乃這女孩溫柔體貼的一面。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就像點餐時料理還附贈味噌湯的這種高興。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有一個能夠輕鬆、自然相處的人在，真的是一件很寶貴的事。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以，我想幫忙她表達這份感激。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，都放進去了。」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還有什麼事要做我都會幫忙喔。」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「曬的衣服，差不多乾了。」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0220", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，那一起收進來摺衣服吧。」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0221", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為櫻乃也無條件接納我，所以我就能更放鬆地跟她相處。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她剛才說「有葛格在很輕鬆」──對我來說也是一樣的。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，走吧。」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔。」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0222", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "從櫻乃的房間走到陽台，我們分頭取下曬乾的衣服。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "平常是櫻乃來我的房間比較多，所以我很久沒進櫻乃的房間了。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0223", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒什麼，想說櫻乃的房間也好乾淨。」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有其兄必有其妹。」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0224", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……說的也是。」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──這一點，跟有沒有血緣關係完全無關呢。", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是從小時候就一直生活在一起的時光讓我們成為兄妹。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……呃，雖然櫻乃是覺得我們是真的兄妹才這樣說的吧。", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不愧是我妹妹。」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不愧是葛格的妹妹。」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0225", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管怎麼說，我們毫無疑問是兄妹。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且感情很要好。大概我們對彼此來說都是像味噌湯的關係吧。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有這樣的存在，真的是很高興的事呢。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「來摺吧。」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0226", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好～」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「分一半。」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0227", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那這一堆就麻煩櫻乃喔。」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「接下了。」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0228", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們坐在地板上，開始一起摺衣服。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「內褲、內褲，葛格的內褲……」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0229", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……呃，不用特地說出來吧。」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算是兄妹，這樣說出口還是會害羞的。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然平常我也是讓櫻乃幫我摺內褲……", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好像很開心的樣子。」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為葛格的內褲，我還挺喜歡的。」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0230", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我好像聽見妹妹說出奇怪的發言！", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「又大、又舒服，好像可以套在頭上……摺摺。」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0231", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等、等一下，不要套啦！」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃的話好像真的做得出來……", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她基本上是個情緒平淡又冷靜的女孩，但動不動又會說出驚人的話。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不會套，但是想穿看看。」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0232", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她高高舉起摺到一半的我的內褲。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……跟女孩子的內褲比起來，好像很舒適。」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0233", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真好。」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0234", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算妳說真好，我、我很困擾……！」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我忍不住看了一眼衣服堆中櫻乃的內褲。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "的確，跟四角褲比起來，那件很貼身很緊的樣子……", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可、可是，女孩子那裡沒有多長一根，所以貼身也沒關係吧？", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我到底在思考什麼……", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好、好了好了，繼續摺吧！」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「盯……」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0235", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還是想穿看看。」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0236", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不行！」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「相對的，葛格也可以穿我的。」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0237", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「被男人穿了會鬆掉啦！」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然覺得問題不在這裡，但一時之間我也想不到怎麼回應她。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒關係。」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0238", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒關係嗎？」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「舊的就給你。」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0239", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "問題真的不是在這裡……", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「條紋內褲跟綁繩內褲，選你喜歡的。」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0240", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她真的拿出舊內褲了！", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用啦妳把內褲收好！」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……這樣啊。」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0241", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「條紋內褲就算了，綁繩內褲沒辦法套頭嘛。」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0242", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我才不會穿也不會套！」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好可惜……摺、摺……」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0243", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嘴裡說著可惜，櫻乃繼續摺我的四角褲。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃的那種發言真的讓身為哥哥的我很困擾。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……？」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0244", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "注意到我的視線，櫻乃停止動作抬起頭。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然不讓我穿，但你想要穿看看？」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0245", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不對不對不對！」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不管怎麼樣，跟櫻乃相處好放鬆真好。」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟其他女孩子絕對不會有的對話，跟櫻乃的話，我沒有半點壓力。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "綜合所有因素，她是我覺得全世界相處起來最輕鬆的女孩子。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這就是我的妹妹，櫻乃。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 4, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0246", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 5, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不愧是妹妹。」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0247", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃很罕見地燦爛一笑，點點頭。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 7, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為我是葛格的空氣。」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0248", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算沒有特別意識依然會呼吸。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以前有氣喘的我，很明白能夠無意識地正常呼吸是多麼奢侈的事情──", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……說地也是，今後也麻煩妳了。」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 11, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我會的。」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0249", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以櫻乃的比喻我覺得很到位。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比我剛才想到的味噌湯更沁入心脾。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 14, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「葛格也是。」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0250", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我會的。」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 16, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「讓我穿內褲。」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0251", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂！」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 18, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「被兇了。」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0252", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然這樣說，但櫻乃感覺很愉快地繼續摺衣服。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue08", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在外面不能說那種話喔。」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue08", "row": 1, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒問題。」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0253", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue08", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃點點頭。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue08", "row": 3, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為是葛格才有趣。」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sk0254", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue08", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不要太戲弄哥哥喔。」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 308, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue08", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過在某種意義上這或許也是哥哥的特權吧。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
